<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Campus <span>Lost & Found</span></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="/lost-items">Lost Items</a>
      <a href="/found-items">Found Items</a>
      <a href="/students/new">Student Profile</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">CAMPUS COMMUNITY</p>
    <h1>Lost something? Found something?</h1>
    <p class="intro">A simple place for students to report belongings and help them find their way back to their owners.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/lost-items/new">Report Lost Item</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/found-items/new">Report Found Item</a>
    </div>
    <section class="home-cards">
      <a class="home-card" href="/lost-items"><span class="card-icon">⌕</span><h2>Lost Items</h2><p>See items reported missing around campus.</p><span class="text-link">View lost reports →</span></a>
      <a class="home-card" href="/found-items"><span class="card-icon">✓</span><h2>Found Items</h2><p>Check items that someone has found.</p><span class="text-link">View found reports →</span></a>
      <a class="home-card" href="/students/new"><span class="card-icon">♙</span><h2>Student Profile</h2><p>Create a profile before reporting an item.</p><span class="text-link">Create profile →</span></a>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer>Campus Lost & Found Management System · Phase 1</footer>
</body>
</html>